==Battleground==
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Saki Matsuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

